comment 3F:E1E0 CondNearAbsDiff — em CondOpponentNear: normaliza o sinal da diferenca de X
label 3F:E1E6 CondNearLimit
comment 3F:E1E6 CondNearLimit — em CondOpponentNear: compara |dx| com $21
label 3F:E239 CondGrabAbsDiff
comment 3F:E239 CondGrabAbsDiff — em CondCanGrab: normaliza o sinal da diferenca de X
label 3F:E252 CondGrabOpponentClass
